==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Sir Seal]]s spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 3.33~10 seconds<sup>100f~300f</sup>.
*2 [[Sir Seal]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 0.67 seconds<sup>20f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Bore]] spawns as the boss.
**48 [[Sir Seal]]s spawn, delay 0.67~2 seconds<sup>20f~60f</sup>.
**24 [[Sir Seal]]s spawn, delay 0.67~2 seconds<sup>20f~60f</sup>.
**12 [[Sir Seal]]s spawn, delay 0.67~2 seconds<sup>20f~60f</sup>.

==Strategy==
[[Ancient Egg: N101 (Rare Cat)|Courier Cat]], [[Apple Cat (Super Rare Cat)|iCat]], some meatshields, [[Sushi Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Roe Cat]] and [[Crazed Fish Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Whale Cat]] are essentially all you need to beat this level.

Simply stall the initial Sir Seals using iCats then spam attackers to easily achieve all the [[Timed Score Reward]]s.

